{"id":180,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自立と探究を育てる女子聖学院中高","feature_description":"女子聖学院中学校高等学校は、キリスト教主義と女子教育を土台に、探究学習、英語教育、学習支援を重ねて自立した学びを育てる学校です。礼拝やMPM、ハンドベルクワイアなどの活動も含め、生徒が自分の言葉で考えを発信し、他者と協働しながら成長する環境が整っています。学習室やラーニングセンターで日々の学びを支えます。学習習慣の定着と自己管理力を養う支援も整っています。","clubs":[{"id":3200,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.joshiseigakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3201,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.joshiseigakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3202,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.joshiseigakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3203,"name":"チアリーディング部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.joshiseigakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3204,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.joshiseigakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3205,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.joshiseigakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3206,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.joshiseigakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3207,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.joshiseigakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3208,"name":"コーラス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.joshiseigakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3209,"name":"軽音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.joshiseigakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3210,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.joshiseigakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3211,"name":"筝曲部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.joshiseigakuin.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3212,"name":"バトン部","categor